## Plugins

### Custom Plugin Example

```javascript
// tailwind.config.js
const plugin = require('tailwindcss/plugin')

module.exports = {
  plugins: [
    plugin(function({ addUtilities, addComponents, e, config }) {
      // Add custom utilities
